WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.702
-The president bragged about
his TV ratings

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.303
during the coronavirus pandemic,

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:06.505
suggested states
were lying about how many

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:08.574
ventilators they need
and blamed health care workers

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:10.376
for the lack of masks.

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.912
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.382
♪♪

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:18.117
You know, we're all just
trying to get through

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.719
this quarantine period
any way we can.

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:23.890
For many, it means working from
home while watching the kids.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.592
For others, it means
taking up new hobbies.

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:29.762
And for many essential workers,
it means having to go to work

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:32.265
without adequate pay,
protections, or sick leave.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:36.802
And then for everyone else,
there's, you know, liquor.

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:38.438
As you can see here, I have
a bottle of scotch

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.072
I've been working on
all morning.

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:42.741
I like to ease into it
by just a little nip,

00:00:42.741 --> 00:00:45.178
just the littlest of nip
into my coffee mug.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.447
And then I just
sanitize my hands in that

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.516
and then I drink directly
from the old bottle.

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:52.752
Mmm.

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:55.788
Now, apparently I'm not
the only one,

00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:57.790
because one of
President Trump's staunchest

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.893
allies on Fox News,
Jeanine Pirro,

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:04.030
