and get eaten by one.

00:12:36.922 --> 00:12:39.190
And then during his press
conference on Sunday night,

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.160
as experts were warning
that we could see as many as

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:46.898
100,000 to 200,000 deaths
