00:12:46.898 --> 00:12:50.035
Trump decided it was
a good time to double down

00:12:50.035 --> 00:12:52.437
and to brag about his ratings.

00:12:52.437 --> 00:12:54.173
-As "The New York Times"
said, we have

00:12:54.173 --> 00:12:56.741
"Monday Night Football"
type ratings.

00:12:56.741 --> 00:12:59.811
But even they said that the
ratings are like

00:12:59.811 --> 00:13:01.780
"Monday Night Football"
ratings,

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.883
And that these are like
"Bachelor" finale --

00:13:04.883 --> 00:13:06.318
that's their end.

00:13:06.318 --> 00:13:08.153
When the big deal happened --
I have no idea what happened

00:13:08.153 --> 00:13:09.755
because I'm too busy
working on this.

00:13:09.755 --> 00:13:11.590
Someday you will tell me
what happened.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:14.292
-No, we won't.
That's your punishment.

00:13:14.292 --> 00:13:17.229
You have to watch it yourself,
months after everyone else

00:13:17.229 --> 00:13:19.097
when nobody wants to talk
about it anymore.

00:13:19.097 --> 00:13:20.399
And at dinner parties,
you'll say,

00:13:20.399 --> 00:13:21.767
"Did you guys see
'The Bachelor'?"

00:13:21.767 --> 00:13:23.101
And people will say,
"We don't want to talk about

00:13:23.101 --> 00:13:25.070
'The Bachelor.'"
And then you'll have to say,

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.806
"Well, did you hear how many
countries there are?

00:13:27.806 --> 00:13:30.575
I know, but do you know?"

00:13:30.575 --> 00:13:33.178
Trump is bragging about
TV ratings and his own

00:13:33.178 --> 00:13:35.080
disastrous response
to the crisis

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.749
even after intelligence
briefings

00:13:36.749 --> 00:13:38.483
and his own health secretary
tried to warn him

00:13:38.483 --> 00:13:39.985
that it was serious.

00:13:39.985 --> 00:13:41.486
In fact, "The Washington Post"
reported that

00:13:41.486 --> 00:13:44.423
Health Secretary Alex Azar
had asked for $2 billion

00:13:44.423 --> 00:13:46.925
to buy respirator masks
and other supplies

00:13:46.925 --> 00:13:50.162
