00:13:58.637 --> 00:14:00.606
the White House had
second thoughts.

00:14:00.606 --> 00:14:03.508
So you couldn't spare
a few billion

00:14:03.508 --> 00:14:05.444
for emergency medical supplies
and ventilators

00:14:05.444 --> 00:14:07.145
as a deadly virus
was spreading,

00:14:07.145 --> 00:14:08.880
but you had trillions
