00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:20.926
with his flamethrower.

00:14:20.926 --> 00:14:22.961
It would be like
a Quentin Tarantino movie.

00:14:22.961 --> 00:14:25.330
And now after repeatedly
ignoring the crisis,

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.665
pitting the states
against each other,

00:14:26.665 --> 00:14:28.133
and bragging about
his TV ratings,

00:14:28.133 --> 00:14:29.968
Trump is actually suggesting
that state officials

00:14:29.968 --> 00:14:32.203
and hospitals are either
lying about what they need

00:14:32.203 --> 00:14:35.340
or possibly even
stealing supplies.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.975
First he said this...

00:14:36.975 --> 00:14:38.610
-New York is a, uh,
bigger deal,

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.879
but it's going to go also.

00:14:40.879 --> 00:14:43.882
But I have a feeling that
a lot of the numbers

00:14:43.882 --> 00:14:45.417
that are being said
in some areas

00:14:45.417 --> 00:14:47.853
are just bigger than
they're going to be.

00:14:47.853 --> 00:14:51.457
I don't believe you need
40,000 or 30,000 ventilators.

00:14:51.457 --> 00:14:53.592
You know, you go into
major hospitals sometimes,

00:14:53.592 --> 00:14:55.060
they'll have two ventilators.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:56.795
And now all of a sudden
they're saying,

00:14:56.795 --> 00:14:59.097
"Can we order
30,000 ventilators?"

00:14:59.097 --> 00:15:02.901
And, you know, they say,
like Governor Cuomo and others,

00:15:02.901 --> 00:15:05.737
that say, "We want, you know,
30,000 of them."

00:15:05.737 --> 00:15:08.039
30,000?
Think of this.

00:15:08.039 --> 00:15:10.642
You know, you go to hospitals,
they'll have one in a hospital.

00:15:10.642 --> 00:15:12.978
And now all of a sudden
everybody's asking

00:15:12.978 --> 00:15:14.679
for these vast numbers.

00:15:14.679 --> 00:15:16.548
-What do you mean,
all of a sudden?

00:15:16.548 --> 00:15:20.786
Yes, yes, all of a sudden
there's a pandemic,

00:15:20.786 --> 00:15:22.554
which means all of a sudden

00:15:22.554 --> 00:15:24.689
a bunch of people
need ventilators.

00:15:24.689 --> 00:15:26.658
Pandemics aren't weddings.

00:15:26.658 --> 00:15:29.494
They don't send you
a "save the date" card.

00:15:29.494 --> 00:15:32.264
Although based on how you
ignored repeated warnings

00:15:32.264 --> 00:15:33.665
that this was a possibility,

00:15:33.665 --> 00:15:35.367
you'd probably throw that
in the trash, too.

00:15:35.367 --> 00:15:37.336
I mean, have you not
been paying attention

00:15:37.336 --> 00:15:40.505
to, like, any of the news
besides your own ratings

00:15:40.505 --> 00:15:42.207
and what Harry and Meghan
are up to?

00:15:42.207 --> 00:15:44.509
Somebody please, for the love
of God, squeeze some information

00:15:44.509 --> 00:15:46.911
