the celebrity quotes section

00:15:46.911 --> 00:15:48.646
of "Us Weekly."

00:15:48.646 --> 00:15:51.049
Nick Jonas says of his marriage
to Priyanka Chopra,

00:15:51.049 --> 00:15:52.650
"She's such a breath
of fresh air,

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.352
