New York needs

00:15:54.352 --> 00:15:56.388
40,000 lifesaving ventilators
because of

00:15:56.388 --> 00:15:59.224
the exponential growth of an
incredibly infectious disease."

00:15:59.224 --> 00:16:01.193
But Trump's grotesque conspiracy
theories about

00:16:01.193 --> 00:16:03.295
the urgent lack of medical
supplies didn't stop there.

00:16:03.295 --> 00:16:05.964
On Sunday night, he implied
something fishy was also

00:16:05.964 --> 00:16:09.001
going on with the lack of masks
in New York City hospitals,

00:16:09.001 --> 00:16:11.603
implying that
heroic medical professionals

00:16:11.603 --> 00:16:14.273
who are literally
putting their lives at risk

00:16:14.273 --> 00:16:17.509
might be hoarding
or stealing the masks.

00:16:17.509 --> 00:16:22.580
-They've been delivering for
years 10,000 to 20,000 masks.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.315
Okay, it's a New York hospital,
very --

00:16:24.315 --> 00:16:25.750
it's packed all the time.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:29.754
How do you go from 10,000
to 20,000 to 300,000?

00:16:29.754 --> 00:16:35.327
10,000 to 20,000 masks
to 300,000,

00:16:35.327 --> 00:16:37.662
even though this is different.

00:16:37.662 --> 00:16:39.431
Something's going on.

00:16:39.431 --> 00:16:41.800
And you ought to look into it
as reporters.

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.101
Where are the masks going?

00:16:43.101 --> 00:16:44.669
Are they going
out the back door?

00:16:44.669 --> 00:16:46.271
I would like them
to check that,

00:16:46.271 --> 00:16:48.640
because I hear stories
like that all the time.

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.109
You know, we're delivering
millions and millions

00:16:51.109 --> 00:16:52.945
of different products,

00:16:52.945 --> 00:16:56.348
and all we do is hear that,
"Can you get some more?"

00:16:56.348 --> 00:16:58.350
So I think people
should check that,

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.385
because there's something
going on.

00:17:00.385 --> 00:17:01.686
I don't think it's hoarding.

00:17:01.686 --> 00:17:03.621
I think it's maybe worse
than hoarding.

00:17:03.621 --> 00:17:06.591
-I'm not wearing a mask,
but if I did, I would remove it

00:17:06.591 --> 00:17:08.894
to make sure you could hear me
clearly when I say,

00:17:08.894 --> 00:17:10.528
[bleep] off.

00:17:10.528 --> 00:17:12.364
Trump thinks they might be
stealing masks

00:17:12.364 --> 00:17:14.500
because he would
definitely steal masks.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.367
Trump is so deeply
and completely corrupt,

00:17:16.367 --> 00:17:19.938
he can't even imagine someone
having a legitimate motivation.

00:17:19.938 --> 00:17:22.307
I'm surprised he hasn't opened
a press conference saying,

00:17:22.307 --> 00:17:24.810
"Bad news --
ventilators went missing.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.846
Good news -- you guys, we found
a corresponding amount

00:17:27.846 --> 00:17:31.650
