which are very affordable."

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.353
Think about how grotesque
this is.

00:17:34.353 --> 00:17:37.055
Health care professionals are
courageously putting their lives

00:17:37.055 --> 00:17:40.425
on the line, and Trump is
baselessly accusing them

00:17:40.425 --> 00:17:42.027
of stealing masks
and lying about

00:17:42.027 --> 00:17:44.596
