00:17:53.271 --> 00:17:57.108
-10,000 known or suspes --
gang members.

00:17:57.108 --> 00:17:59.110
Advising law markers.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.679
Will not be toleri--

00:18:01.679 --> 00:18:05.316
-We had a chance to avoid the
fate we're currently suffering,

00:18:05.316 --> 00:18:07.752
and our president squandered it
by ignoring the problem

00:18:07.752 --> 00:18:11.056
for weeks and then pretending
it would go away.

00:18:11.056 --> 00:18:13.591
Now health care professionals
are putting themselves in danger

00:18:13.591 --> 00:18:14.993
and begging for supplies,

00:18:14.993 --> 00:18:17.930
and the president instead
