his TV ratings.

00:18:20.531 --> 00:18:22.200
When this is all over
and the history of this moment

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.769
is written, the kindest thing
you'll be able to say

00:18:24.769 --> 00:18:27.238
about Trump is that...
-Ended up looking like a fool.

00:18:27.238 --> 00:18:28.907
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:18:28.907 --> 00:18:32.210
♪♪

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.680
Hey, just a reminder,
